{"title":"Stronger Than You","artist":"Steven Universe","date":"2026-08-04","sourceId":"14524675:037","sourceHash":"f807721f30baa1a2cd90230df02be5fde7abba5e9b433550c3369fef9cbe2bab","duration":176.24,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":14.34,"end":15.48,"text":"This is Garnet","translation":"이쪽은 가넷","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":15.48,"end":16.26,"text":"Back together","translation":"다시 하나가 됐어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":16.26,"end":19.9,"text":"And I'm never going down at the hands of the likes of you","translation":"너 같은 것의 손에 절대 쓰러지지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":19.9,"end":21.84,"text":"Because I'm so much better","translation":"내가 훨씬 더 나으니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":21.84,"end":24.94,"text":"And every part of me is saying \"go get her\"","translation":"내 모든 부분이 가서 해치우라 외치니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":24.94,"end":26.38,"text":"The two of us ain't gonna follow your rules","translation":"우리 둘은 네 규칙 따위 따르지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":26.38,"end":29.18,"text":"Come at me without any of your fancy tools","translation":"그 화려한 도구 없이 내게 덤벼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":29.18,"end":31.58,"text":"Let's go, just me and you","translation":"해 보자 너와 나 둘이서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":31.58,"end":33.36,"text":"Let's go, just one on two","translation":"해 보자 둘을 상대로 혼자서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":33.36,"end":35.62,"text":"Go ahead and try and hit me if you're able","translation":"할 수 있다면 날 때려 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":35.62,"end":37.96,"text":"Can't you see that my relationship is stable?","translation":"우리 관계가 단단한 게 안 보여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":37.96,"end":40.62,"text":"I can see you hate the way we intermingle","translation":"우리가 섞이는 모습이 네겐 싫겠지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":40.62,"end":42.9,"text":"But I think you're just mad 'cause you're single","translation":"하지만 넌 혼자라 화난 것뿐인 것 같아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":42.9,"end":45.02,"text":"And you're not gonna stop what we made together","translation":"우리가 함께 만든 걸 넌 막지 못해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":45.02,"end":47.36,"text":"We are gonna stay like this forever","translation":"우린 영원히 이 모습으로 남을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":47.36,"end":49.96,"text":"If you break us apart we'll just come back newer","translation":"우릴 갈라놓아도 새 모습으로 돌아와","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":49.96,"end":52.976,"text":"And we'll always be twice the gem that you are","translation":"그리고 언제나 너보다 두 배 빛나는 보석일 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":52.976,"end":55.72,"text":"I am made o-o-o-o-of","translation":"나는 이루어졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":55.72,"end":59.13,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"사 아 아 아 랑으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":59.13,"end":65.26,"text":"O-o-o-o-of","translation":"이루어졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":65.26,"end":65.98,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"사 아 아 아 랑으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":65.98,"end":67.02,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"사 아 아 아 랑으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":67.02,"end":73.707,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"사 아 아 아 랑으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":78.74,"end":84.69,"text":"Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm","translation":"음음음음음 음음음음음 음음음음음","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":92.28,"end":94.38,"text":"This is who we are","translation":"이게 바로 우리야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":94.38,"end":96.74,"text":"This is who I am","translation":"이게 바로 나야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":96.74,"end":99.34,"text":"And if you think you can stop me","translation":"네가 날 막을 수 있다고 생각한다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":99.34,"end":102.08,"text":"Then you need to think again","translation":"다시 생각해야 할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":102.08,"end":103.76,"text":"'Cause I am a feeling","translation":"나는 하나의 감정이니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":103.76,"end":106.28,"text":"And I will never end","translation":"나는 절대 끝나지 않으니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":106.28,"end":108.82,"text":"And I won't let you hurt my planet","translation":"내 행성을 네가 해치게 두지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":108.82,"end":111.36,"text":"And I won't let you hurt my friends","translation":"내 친구들을 네가 해치게 두지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":111.36,"end":114.0,"text":"Go ahead and try and hit me if you're able!","translation":"할 수 있다면 날 때려 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":114.0,"end":117.1,"text":"Can't you see that my relationship is stable?","translation":"우리 관계가 단단한 게 안 보여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":117.1,"end":119.12,"text":"I know you think I'm not something you're afraid of","translation":"넌 내가 두려워할 존재가 아니라고 생각하지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":119.12,"end":121.42,"text":"'Cause you think that you've seen what I'm made of","translation":"내가 무엇으로 이루어졌는지 봤다고 여기니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":121.42,"end":123.46,"text":"Well, I am even more than the two of them!","translation":"하지만 나는 그 둘을 합친 것보다 더 커","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":123.46,"end":125.9,"text":"Everything they care about is what I am!","translation":"그들이 아끼는 모든 것이 바로 나야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":125.9,"end":128.52,"text":"I am their fury, I am their patience","translation":"나는 그들의 분노 나는 그들의 인내","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":128.52,"end":130.98,"text":"I am a conversation!","translation":"나는 둘의 대화야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":130.98,"end":132.76,"text":"I am made o-o-o-o-of","translation":"나는 이루어졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":132.76,"end":136.62,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"사 아 아 아 랑으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":136.62,"end":139.84,"text":"O-o-o-o-of","translation":"이루어졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":139.84,"end":141.96,"text":"And it's stronger than you","translation":"그리고 그 사랑은 너보다 강해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":141.96,"end":142.7,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"사 아 아 아 랑으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":142.7,"end":146.9,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"사 아 아 아 랑으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":146.9,"e